# Fiery Temper's "any target": Bot1 kills Bot2's 3/3 Bog Wraith with the first (3 damage, exactly its toughness) and
# aims the second at itself (20 to 17), so a creature, a player who is an opponent and the caster itself are accepted.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby x6
Fiery Temper
Fiery Temper
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet x4
Bog Wraith
Swamp x16

